  "text": "Gold Price in the 2000s\nBetween the first (2000-01-31) and last (2009-12-30) monthly observations available for the 2000s, the LBMA gold price went from $283 to $1,088 — a gain of 284% — with a sampled high of $1,176 (Nov 2009) and a sampled low of $258 (Mar 2001).\nYears in the 2000s\n2000\n2001\n2002\n2003\n2004\n2005\n2006\n2007\n2008\n2009\nSee today's live gold price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop gold bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
